    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "CC92DA5F385CDD12",
      "text": "Then what about that modified car you were\\nmotoring around in just now?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_26",
      "hash64": "2B2D30FF78CE164B",
      "text": "The Starmobile? We made that thing a long time\\nago to help us out with a big fight.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_27",
      "hash64": "2B2D2FFF78CE1498",
      "text": "But we never actually used it against anyone\\nbefore you two came lookin’ for trouble.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "CC92D95F385CDB5F",
      "text": "You never...used it before? And what’s this about\\na big fight?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_28",
      "hash64": "2B2D2EFF78CE12E5",
      "text": "You ever heard of Operation Star?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "CC92D85F385CD9AC",
      "text": "Operation Star...? Not Operation Starfall?\\c\\nNo, this is the first I’m hearing of it.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_29",
      "hash64": "2B2D2DFF78CE1132",
      "text": "Huh. Yeah, I guess you wouldn’t know...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_30",
      "hash64": "2B2A30FF78CBE074",
      "text": "But for me and the rest of Team Star, it’s a\\nmemory we’ll always treasure.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
